{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "krishi-sap-sync-flow-line-by-line",
    "name": "KRISHI Breeder — SAP Sync Flow (line-by-line)",
    "description": "Ordered checks for SAP integration: health → login → **GET status per module** → **POST /push** (dry SAP) → **POST /** (push + mark) → admin list → **POST bulk** → **POST pull** → **POST push-raw** per SAP endpoint.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `baseUrl`, `login_username`, `login_password`.\n2. Run **01 POST Login** — saves `token`.\n3. Set each `record_id_*` to real unsynced ids from your DB (`npm run seed:sap-demo` seeds feeding for today).\n4. Align `plant_code` / `sap_pull_werks` with your farm (e.g. `1902`).\n\n**Auth**\n- Bearer on all routes except health + login.\n- `/pull`, `/push-raw`, `/unsynced`, `/push-unsynced` → **Super Admin** or **Farm Manager** (see `SAP_SYNC_ADMIN_ROLES`).\n\n**POST routes (this API)**\n| Route | Role | Purpose |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| `POST /api/admin/login` | — | JWT |\n| `POST /api/sap-sync/push` | any synced user | SAP call only; DB **unchanged** |\n| `POST /api/sap-sync` | same | SAP + set `sap_synced` on **2xx** |\n| `POST /api/sap-sync/pull` | admin | GET from SAP → DB |\n| `POST /api/sap-sync/push-raw` | admin | Exact SAP query params |\n| `POST /api/sap-sync/push-unsynced` | admin | Bulk push + mark |\n\nRun folders top-to-bottom for a line-by-line regression.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "login_username", "value": "your_username" },
    { "key": "login_password", "value": "your_password" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "plant_code", "value": "1902" },
    { "key": "sap_pull_werks", "value": "1902" },
    { "key": "record_id_feeding", "value": "2", "description": "flock_feeding_log.id (seed:sap-demo)" },
    { "key": "record_id_egg_collection", "value": "1", "description": "egg_collection_header.id" },
    { "key": "record_id_mortality", "value": "1", "description": "mortality_log.id" },
    { "key": "record_id_cull_kill", "value": "1", "description": "cull_kill_log.id" },
    { "key": "record_id_cull_sales", "value": "1", "description": "cull_sales_header.id" },
    { "key": "record_id_bird_weighing", "value": "1", "description": "flock_bird_weight.id" },
    { "key": "bulk_limit_per_module", "value": "10" },
    { "key": "unsynced_list_limit", "value": "30" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 GET — smoke",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "API process up."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 POST — login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/admin/login (saves token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                  "    pm.test('token saved to collection', () => true);",
                  "  } else {",
                  "    pm.test('token missing — check username/password/category', () => false);",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) { pm.test('JSON parse failed', () => false); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{login_username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{login_password}}\",\n  \"category\": \"Breeder\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
            "description": "Response field `token`. Test script copies it to collection variable `token`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 GET — /api/sap-sync/status (one per module)",
